# SavedViews language file - English
ModuleSavedViewsName=SavedViews
SavedViewsDescription=Save and restore custom views (filters, columns, display mode) on list pages
SavedViewsDescriptionLong=Adds a bar of bookmark tabs above every Dolibarr list page, letting each user save the current view (search filters, selected columns, list/kanban mode) and reopen it in one click. A view is private by default and can be shared with user groups or with all users. Each user can pick a default view per list.

